 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental service
+
+Import `createRentalService` from `src/index.ts` to create an in-memory equipment catalog and
+booking desk. Add boards or sails with `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })`, where `dailyPrice`
+is a non-negative integer number of euro cents per day. `quote({ itemId, start, end })` calculates
+the price, and `book(...)` reserves the item and returns its booking ID. Rental timestamps must be
+ISO-8601 UTC midnight strings. The start is included and the end is exclusive, so a one-day rental
+ends at midnight on the following day. Equipment cannot have overlapping bookings. The service
+does not persist data after it is discarded. Cancellation is not implemented yet.
